	measure 'Trade Balance (US$)' = ```
			
			VAR _Exports = [Exports of Goods & Services (US$)]
			VAR _Imports = [Imports of Goods & Services (US$)]
			RETURN
			IF(
			    NOT ISBLANK(_Exports) || NOT ISBLANK(_Imports),
			    _Exports - _Imports,
			    BLANK()
			)
			
			```
		formatString: #,##0
		displayFolder: 04 Trade
		lineageTag: 491670c7-3958-4644-a393-9dd8e1832f57

